01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LJSOoonWvA0Q7kNvwFMllQh&_nc_oc=Adqq-fSN1T5m6HNLCmLVWr5b_R4kgh_YmlnkyIhhYG0xhQN1x-Brz6ntVUr5kjpVP00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCDFKMPaH_7Jj4AjC3JMz0ZJix30mw_D5x1NkTH0ybZMg&oe=6A5A153D"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y8sumxshZNcQ7kNvwEewalN&_nc_oc=Adrr97o_35b8H_0itGnNud5lqmg-cDvQfyldBByEQOEHAzI4C5gzllkDDXrVTvaBjtE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCSdWH2YBP1dqOYJhe-fYVzz6W6HF70LLbtctSyT33hSg&oe=6A5A33BB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LsxaDliHqo4Q7kNvwHvDkgs&_nc_oc=Ado8pEKQD8UzwlarrrD2RIpvvMffgtOfE-oAl_SDJzBUSOYBkErVPi1gGR1f8vxYJF8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAQOuKfW19M9GMJiOGre91X4I0hglngdPiAQRejAOxZOw&oe=6A5A48E5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a